<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>iProp X — Property technology that connects sellers and buyers</title>
<meta name="description" content="iProp X is property technology that matches sellers to buyers and buyers to sellers, built on grounded property data with an AI intelligence layer.">
<link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 64 64'%3E%3Crect width='64' height='64' rx='14' fill='%230f172a'/%3E%3Ctext x='32' y='43' font-family='Arial,sans-serif' font-size='30' font-weight='700' text-anchor='middle' fill='%2322d3ee'%3EiX%3C/text%3E%3C/svg%3E">
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;color:#0f172a;background:#f8fafc;line-height:1.6}
.wrap{max-width:880px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px}
header{background:#0f172a;color:#fff;padding:56px 0 64px}
.logo{font-size:2.6rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:0}.logo span{color:#22d3ee}
.tag{font-size:1.25rem;color:#cbd5e1;margin:8px 0 0}
section{padding:40px 0}h2{font-size:1.4rem;margin:0 0 12px}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(240px,1fr));gap:20px}
.card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:12px;padding:22px}
.card h3{margin:0 0 8px}
.contact a.btn{display:inline-block;margin:6px 10px 6px 0;padding:12px 18px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}
.email{background:#0f172a;color:#fff}.wa{background:#16a34a;color:#fff}
.small{color:#475569;font-size:.95rem}
.soon{background:#ecfeff;border:1px solid #a5f3fc;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 18px}
footer{padding:28px 0;color:#64748b;font-size:.9rem;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header><div class="wrap">
<h1 class="logo">iProp <span>X</span></h1>
<p class="tag">Smarter connections between property sellers and buyers.</p>
</div></header>
<main class="wrap">
<section>
<h2>What we do</h2>
<p>iProp X is property technology that matches sellers to buyers and buyers to sellers. It is built on grounded property data, with an AI intelligence layer that helps surface relevant matches and insight.</p>
</section>
<section>
<div class="grid">
<div class="card"><h3>For sellers</h3><p>Tell us about your property and what you're looking for. We use property data to help connect you with buyers whose needs fit what you're offering.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>For buyers</h3><p>Share what you want to buy and where. We help you discover properties and sellers that match your criteria, backed by grounded data.</p></div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="contact">
<h2>Get in touch</h2>
<a class="btn email" href="mailto:ipropxai@gmail.com">Email ipropxai@gmail.com</a>
<a class="btn wa" href="https://wa.me/447770201572" rel="noopener">Message us on WhatsApp</a>
<p class="small">WhatsApp 07770 201572 — messages only, no calls.</p>
</section>
<section><p class="soon">Full site coming soon at <strong>ipropx.ai</strong></p></section>
</main>
<footer><div class="wrap">© 2026 iProp X</div></footer>
</body>
</html>
